 "provenance": "Tibet 8 (world 2, level 7) normal exit 5,14, control-only from the stage spawn on the exact S700 core (paint-every-frame harness). Start values: weaponTier 8 (ice hammer from the Tibet 6 chest 32,22; Tibet 7+ may start with it; required here to freeze shooters, the ice creature and to use frozen blocks), maxHealth 4 (no armor; no damage is taken), lives 12 (campaign value used by the other Tibet routes; no life is lost), diamonds 0 (per-stage HUD; the 70-diamond magic lock at 6,14 does not block in S700 1.2.0: its tile is cleared at map load, cGame map scan case 12; the route collects 31 diamonds). Route: walk-in, checkpoint 0 (4,11), checkpoint 1 / riddle room 0 (2 kills): push the weight 16,4 right into column 17 (lands at 17,14 and raises an updraft, method_311/method_307), freeze shooter 16,8, push it into the updraft (rises to 17,4) and from 16,4 into column 18 (falls to 18,11); hook the weight to 16,14 and push it to 15,14 (updraft column 15), freeze shooter 16,6, push it into column 15 (rises to 15,4) and from 16,4 into column 14 (falls to 14,11); one hammer hit clears the bricks 16,10-11; thaw both shooters from above (14,10 / 18,10); step from 16,10 into 16,11 and straight back: both shooters fire (method_312) and their darts kill each other (method_334). Riddle room 1 (5 kills, checkpoint 2 at 25,13): freeze shooter 30,5 from 31,5 and push it left so it falls onto shooter 29,8 (crushed, method_343); freeze shooter 26,7 from 25,7 and push it right onto shooter 27,10 (crushed); drop both ice blocks to the floor (26,13, 28,13); freeze shooter 32,9 and push it right (falls to 33,13); thaw the three from row 12; step from 30,12 into 30,13 and back: the three darts kill all three. Checkpoint 3 (36,13): break brick 40,9, hook stone 41,9 from 38,9 (falls to 39,14); break brick 40,11, freeze the ice creature at 40,11, hook it from 38,11 so it falls onto the stone, stand at 38,13 so it cannot roll off (method_351) and push it right twice: it drops onto plate 41,14 and gate 42,13 opens; checkpoint 4 (43,13). Freezing statue 47,10-11 (tile 48): hooked from 45,11 to column 46 and pushed back right so its beam faces left (method_305/method_306), then lowered to 47,13-14 by cutting the grass 47,12, 47,13, 47,14 from the side (45,13 and 46,13 cut too): its beam runs along row 13 (method_239/method_237 pass empty cells, freezable creatures and the tile-31 glass at 9,13) up to the raised bridge 10,13. Through the grass 44,14-16 into the diamond corridor (31 diamonds), push stone 12,16 to 11,16, hammer the bridge switch 12,17 from 12,16 (bridge 10,13 lowers, method_232), push the stone on to 10,16; the beam now reaches the walker (tile 49) pacing column 8: it is frozen at 8,13 (method_240) and falls onto plate 8,16, opening gate 9,15. Walk 11,15 -> 9,15 -> 8,14 -> 6,14 -> exit 5,14. Health 4 throughout, no deaths, no resets.",
